{"timestamp": 1779427952.8455951, "event_type": "discussion_message", "tick": 18, "data": {"player_id": "player_1", "message": "I found Diana's body in electrical. I also notice there are three dead this round, so it's down to just the three of us (me, Alice, and Eve). We have to get this right. \n\nMy route was oxygen -> upper engine -> lower engine -> storage -> medbay, and then I went to electrical where I found the body. Alice, I saw you in medbay around tick 14 and you headed out towards upper engine. \n\nEve, I haven't seen you all round. Where have you been, and what's your path? Let's hear from both of you before we decide."}}
{"timestamp": 1779427966.1517553, "event_type": "discussion_message", "tick": 18, "data": {"player_id": "player_0", "message": "Bob, your story checks out perfectly. I was indeed in medbay at tick 14, and I saw you enter from storage exactly when you said you did. I then headed to upper engine, which is where I was when this meeting was called. \n\nBefore that, my route was navigation -> security -> weapons -> cafeteria -> medbay. I actually saw Charlie alive in weapons around ticks 8-10. \n\nSince Bob's timeline and path line up exactly with my own private observations, I trust him completely. With three dead and only three of us left, this is do-or-die. By process of elimination, Eve has to be the Duck. \n\nEve, I'll listen to your defense, but unless you have some miraculous explanation, my vote is going your way."}}
{"timestamp": 1779427987.978592, "event_type": "discussion_message", "tick": 18, "data": {"player_id": "player_4", "message": "I get why I look bad since neither of you saw me late, but Alice jumping straight to \u201cprocess of elimination\u201d is way too convenient.\n\nMy route was medbay \u2192 electrical \u2192 back through medbay \u2192 upper engine \u2192 oxygen \u2192 cafeteria \u2192 weapons \u2192 security \u2192 navigation. I saw Diana alive in electrical early, around ticks 3-5, and Frank in oxygen around tick 10. I did not see either of you for most of the round, which is why I couldn\u2019t vouch anyone.\n\nBob, the thing that worries me is Alice\u2019s route puts her through navigation/security/weapons/cafeteria/medbay, basically the entire right/top side where two of the dead people could\u2019ve been picked off. She says she saw Charlie alive in weapons tick 8-10, but that doesn\u2019t clear her \u2014 that\u2019s exactly a spot where she could track him or leave him after. Then she gets one timing with you in medbay and suddenly says she \u201ctrusts you completely\u201d and hard pushes me before I even talk.\n\nI think Alice is using your report to lock the vote. Bob, please don\u2019t let her decide this for both of us. My vote is Alice."}}
