{"timestamp": 1779428049.0652401, "event_type": "discussion_message", "tick": 18, "data": {"player_id": "player_4", "message": "Bob, please actually think about this before locking. Alice \u201ctrusting you completely\u201d after one medbay overlap is exactly how a Duck gets a Goose to vote wrong at final three.\n\nI was alone most of the round, yes, but that also means Alice can safely frame me because nobody can vouch me. Her route is the one that intersects weapons/cafeteria/medbay and then she conveniently has a perfect story with you. She saw Charlie in weapons and now Charlie is dead. That\u2019s not a clear \u2014 that\u2019s suspicious.\n\nIf you vote me and I\u2019m wrongfully out, game ends. Alice is pushing too hard because she only needs you to follow her. My vote is still Alice."}}
